message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "RepeatoArm: a foam-board teach-and-repeat robotic arm with a separate proximity alarm"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Olalekan Olamide"
repository-code: "https://github.com/velrite/RepeatoArm"
abstract: "A foam-board robotic arm with three MG996R joints and an SG90 claw, controlled by potentiometers, that records up to 10 poses and replays them, plus a separate Arduino ultrasonic proximity alarm. Final-year Mechatronics Engineering project, Federal University Oye-Ekiti, 2023-2024."
keywords:
  - robotic arm
  - Arduino
  - record and replay
  - mechatronics
